      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `upload_object.py` file, I need to use a concrete external provider for managed object storage. I will choose AWS S3 as the provider because it is a widely used and well-documented service. The code will include the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, to interact with S3. This will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
